              "summary": "The supplied source and injection-specific assessment establish that request input can affect query syntax or selector structure in the stated analysis scope. Remediate the injection using the verified database API; the underlying construction-practice concern is included in this one finding.",
              "input_validation": "The value reaches a call or middleware whose validation effect has not been established. Inspect the actual check and whether it runs before this use. Evidence: a call receives searchParams before the sink, and that call is not a proven validator Model validation answer: insufficient. This operation-level answer is not an independent field-policy finding.",
              "use_protection": "Assessed injection/use protection: insufficient. Source-backed injection claim has required source, binding and path evidence, no declared blockers, and an independent injection-specific insufficient-protection assessment; this is a static judgment, not runtime confirmation.",
