              "input_validation": "Complete enforcement of an applicable field policy was not established in this operation record. Consult any separate field-policy assessment; query binding is a different claim. Evidence: request.headers.get(\"user-agent\") reaches a sensitive use with no validator call in the handler or applicable middleware The value reaches a call or middleware whose validation effect has not been established. Inspect the actual check and whether it runs before this use. Evidence: a call receives request.headers.get(\"x-forwarded-for\") before the sink, and that call is not a proven validator The value reaches a call or middleware whose validation effect has not been established. Inspect the actual check and whether it runs before this use. Evidence: a call receives request.headers.get(\"x-real-ip\") before the sink, and that call is not a proven validator Complete enforcement of an applicable field policy was not established in this operation record. Consult any separate field-policy assessment; query binding is a different claim. Evidence: request.text() reaches a sensitive use with no validator call in the handler or applicable middleware Model validation answer: insufficient. This operation-level answer is not an independent field-policy finding.",
